    bugs: [
      {
        title: '"Sign in twice" — true root cause (onboarding-side)',
        detail: "`CompletePhase.handleFinish` fires `upsertNovaSettingMetadata` as fire-and-forget before navigating to `/(app)`. If the app is backgrounded/killed in the sub-second window before the GQL mutation returns, the backend `onboardedMobile` flag never gets set. On next cold start (or iOS AsyncStorage wipe), `useBootstrapOrg` finds no `onboardedMobile=true`, `useOnboardingStore` reads `completed=false` from blank storage, and the user is sent back to /onboarding. User experience: 'I have to sign in again.'",
        evidence: "CompletePhase.tsx:191–215 · useBootstrapOrg.ts:225–227",
      },
      {
        title: "Race between create-org and bootstrap-org",
        detail: "After `createOrganization` resolves, the phase rebuilds itself and bumps the index. But `useBootstrapOrg` may still be running in parallel — when it lands, it calls `setOrg` which clears `pulseId`. Result: a flash of empty state.",
